Source: camx
Section: non-free/kernel
Priority: optional
Maintainer: CamX Maintainers <camx.maintainers@qti.qualcomm.com>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13), dh-sequence-dkms, cpio
Rules-Requires-Root: no
Standards-Version: 4.7.2
Homepage: https://github.com/qualcomm-linux/camera-driver
Vcs-Browser: https://github.com/qualcomm-linux/pkg-camx-dkms
Vcs-Git: https://github.com/qualcomm-linux/pkg-camx-dkms.git

Package: camx-dkms
Architecture: arm64
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Recommends: linux-headers-generic
Description: Qualcomm CamX camera driver (DKMS)
 This package provides the CamX camera kernel modules built
 using DKMS, allowing automatic rebuilds across kernel
 updates. It is intended for Qualcomm platforms requiring
 CamX support.

Package: camx-uapi-dev
Architecture: arm64
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Description: CamX UAPI headers
 Kernel UAPI headers for the CamX camera driver. These headers
 define the kernel-userspace ABI and are required by userspace
 libraries and applications that interact with CamX.
